    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GUNJUTSU</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca5 <strong>TRICKSHOTTING IS BACK.</strong> This is for the ones who never stopped spinning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GUNJUTSU is a tribute to the <strong>golden age of Trickshotting</strong>\u2014built for those who lived through the OG console era and designed to <strong>feel just like the good old days</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Master the Art of Trickshotting</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work your way down the<strong>\u00a0'Trickshot Iceberg'</strong>, a <strong>fully-fledged tutorial system </strong>that will teach you every skill. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a1 <strong>A Perfect Balance of Skill &amp; Creativity</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>For the OG Trickshotters:</strong> A game with <strong>depth, challenge, and variety.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>For newcomers:</strong> A <strong>step-by-step system</strong> that helps you grow into a Trickshot master.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HOW IT PLAYS:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Stay Airborne\u00a0</strong>\u2013 Earn points <strong>only while in the air</strong>\u2014land, and your score resets!<br>\ud83d\udc80 <strong>Trick &amp; Shoot</strong> \u2013 <strong>You only bank points if you hit the target.</strong> <br>\ud83e\udde9 <strong>A Puzzle-Shooter Like No Other</strong> \u2013 Every level is an open-ended <strong>Trickshot puzzle.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Compete Worldwide with quantitative skills\u00a0</strong>\u2013 Climb the <strong>global Leaderboards</strong> and prove you're <strong>the best Trickshotter alive.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude80 <strong>Wishlist GUNJUTSU now.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GUNJUTSU</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca5 <strong>TRICKSHOTTING IS BACK.</strong> This is for the ones who never stopped spinning.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GUNJUTSU is a tribute to the <strong>golden age of Trickshotting</strong>\u2014built for those who lived through the OG console era and designed to <strong>feel just like the good old days</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Master the Art of Trickshotting</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work your way down the<strong>\u00a0'Trickshot Iceberg'</strong>, a <strong>fully-fledged tutorial system </strong>that will teach you every skill. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a1 <strong>A Perfect Balance of Skill &amp; Creativity</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>For the OG Trickshotters:</strong> A game with <strong>depth, challenge, and variety.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>For newcomers:</strong> A <strong>step-by-step system</strong> that helps you grow into a Trickshot master.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>HOW IT PLAYS:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Stay Airborne\u00a0</strong>\u2013 Earn points <strong>only while in the air</strong>\u2014land, and your score resets!<br>\ud83d\udc80 <strong>Trick &amp; Shoot</strong> \u2013 <strong>You only bank points if you hit the target.</strong> <br>\ud83e\udde9 <strong>A Puzzle-Shooter Like No Other</strong> \u2013 Every level is an open-ended <strong>Trickshot puzzle.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>Compete Worldwide with quantitative skills\u00a0</strong>\u2013 Climb the <strong>global Leaderboards</strong> and prove you're <strong>the best Trickshotter alive.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude80 <strong>Wishlist GUNJUTSU now.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "GUNJUTSU is a Trickshotting FPS that blends skill, creativity, and precision. This is a game about timing, not luck. Learn to perform mid-air gun tricks, 360 spins and noscopes. With an intuitive tutorial system, master new mechanics and become a Trickshotter.",
